WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.516
The viewer follows while the script walks.

00:00:03.516 --> 00:00:04.479
The script is paused at its checkpoint.

00:00:04.479 --> 00:00:05.787
The touch stick moves the bot.

00:00:05.787 --> 00:00:06.936
A swipe turns the camera.

00:00:06.936 --> 00:00:08.438
Pause shows Resume script.

00:00:08.438 --> 00:00:09.323
Manual control ended. The script keeps walking.
